think r1 fixed the quorum crux (a Chorus is believed only when a threshold of distinct nodes agree), r2 let the whole quorum travel as bytes, r3 read it across a Knot — all over Dags seated in code. The closing rung (mirroring voucher_true / statement_true) carries the quorum onto a real on-disk Cord record a keeper can open and hash.
think Studied voucher_true.rye: it @embedFiles the Lapse fixture corpora/lapse_dag.bron, parses through cord_bron, rebuilds the Dag under cord.add (re-verifying signatures), reads the genesis-funded account (received == total_issued, so no magic constant), and emits a measure tuple the witness cross-checks against statement_dag_truth.awk. Mirrored the shape, lifting from one voucher to a whole quorum: chorus_true.vouch_real gathers a three-node quorum over the funded account, verifies at threshold, asserts every member's recomputed order-head matches its signed one, and returns the agreed triple plus the voice count. Kept the process-Init main(selftest|measure) shape verbatim.
obs GREEN on the first build and run. The app's agreed triple for the funded account bc7cbcb5… reads balance 100 / reserved 100 / received 200 (100 spendable, 100 held in the open pledge to Carol, the lapsed pledge to Bob home; the full 200 genesis credit received), and app.out == awk.out byte-for-byte — two tools, one answer. The quorum-specific proofs hold: believed at threshold 3 yet refused BelowThreshold at 4 (the distinct count the threshold reads is exactly the three members present, none invented or double-counted), every member's order-head recomputed from the rebuilt fixture Dag equals its signed one, the quorum checks against the ledger it vouches, and a tampered header refuses BadFormat.
obs Additive: composes cord_bron + cord + lapse + statement + voucher + chorus + kumara public API only (each re-runs GREEN; the Chorus r1 stands at the witness door). Reused the existing mycelium/corpora/lapse_dag.bron symlink — no new fixture or generator. Witness tools/mycelium_chorus_true_witness.rish GREEN, TAME bans clean, width-check exit 0. Demo node/keeper seeds — no key/funds/network/custody; a served chorus reaches the Comlink gate.
